5ed7b78599c6ac53734cc9.avif?t=1757000790 width=800 height=176 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Dice-Based Deckbuilding</strong></i>   <br><i>Build a customizable deck of actions and manipulate cursed dice to survive tense, turn-based encounters with nightmarish foes.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/2584f4336e50dc8762d7b2a721963e49.poster.avif?t=1757000790\" width=1170 height=462 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/2584f4336e50dc8762d7b2a721963e49.webm?t=1757000790\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/extras/2584f4336e50dc8762d7b2a721963e49.mp4?t=1757000790\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Game Within a Game</strong></i>  <br><i>Launch and play a mysterious retro game on a pixelated computer interface \u2014 all while trapped inside a 3D haunted mansion.</i>  <br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Explore a Living Mansion</strong></i>  <br><i>Navigate a gothic English estate full of secrets, puzzles, strange technology, and voices that shouldn't be speaking to you.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Meta-Horror Storytelling</strong></i>  <br><i>Uncover the dark connection between the game and reality. Why was it made? Who is watching? And how do you stop becoming part of it?</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;Die to Progress&quot; Loop</strong></i>  <br><i>Death is not the end \u2014 each failure brings you closer to the truth. Unlock shortcuts, story fragments, and hidden mechanics with every attempt.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Retro Aesthetic Meets Modern Fear</strong></i>  <br><i>Classic PC vibes, CRT scanlines, floppy disks, low-res sprites \u2014 all wrapped in a modern horror experience with deep psychological undertones.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i>   </p></li></ul>","developers":["Kvinter games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784360/c65d659e61f2c69f96088b041ba7ceab2463dec5/header.jpg?t=1757000790","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784360/1940540136/359b2560fd1bfa12944110614c56a5bd3cc93f63/1750580235/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750624404","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784360/1940540136/359b2560fd1bfa12944110614c56a5bd3cc93f63/1750580235/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750624404","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784360/1940540136/359b2560fd1bfa12944110614c56a5bd3cc93f63/1750580235/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750624404","id":257155949,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155949/movie480.mp4?t=1750624404","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155949/movie_max.mp4?t=1750624404"},"name":"First Gameplay Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155949/7da7c9c97ab06d1a06a8e7cbdcc1e43fadfa1eef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750624404","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155949/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750624404","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155949/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750624404"}}],"name":"Die to Play","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Inte